msgid "days"
msgstr "天"

#: admin/views/general-settings.php:82
msgid "This is a permanent, legally significant deletion policy."
msgstr "这是一项永久性的、具有法律意义的删除政策。"

#: admin/views/general-settings.php:84
msgid ""
"NicePay cannot determine which tax, accounting, payment or privacy rules "
"apply to your organization. Obtain legal and accounting approval for the "
"period you enter."
msgstr ""
"NicePay 无法确定哪些税务、会计、付款或隐私规则适用于您的组织。获得您输入期间"
"的法律和会计批准。"

#: admin/views/general-settings.php:85
msgid ""
"The daily job deletes eligible transactions and refund-attempt history only "
"from this plugin. It does not delete WooCommerce orders, backups, logs or "
"records held by NICEPAY."
msgstr ""
"日常工作仅从此插件中删除符合条件的交易和退款尝试历史记录。它不会删除 NICEPAY "
"持有的 WooCommerce 订单、备份、日志或记录。"

#: admin/views/general-settings.php:86
msgid ""
"Pending, approving, reconciliation-required and unknown cancel/refund "
"records are always protected from automatic deletion."
msgstr ""
"待处理、批准、需要核对和未知的取消/退款记录始终受到保护，不会被自动删除。"

#: admin/views/general-settings.php:87
msgid ""
"Deleting a paid or partially refunded ledger record prevents future refunds "
"through this plugin. Export the filtered CSV and verify a recoverable backup "
"before enabling deletion."
msgstr ""
"删除已付款或部分退款的账本记录可防止将来通过此插件退款。导出已过滤的 CSV 并在"
"启用删除之前验证可恢复的备份。"

